*.autosave
# Solver output binaries are ignored by default to prevent accidental commits of
# scratch runs elsewhere in the tree. The curated P6 evidence is already tracked
# (via Git LFS) at its original paths and is explicitly re-included here.
*.hdf5
!p6-physical-validation/runs/**
!p6-physical-validation/_unclassified_solver_scratch/**
*.log
*.egg-info/
src/**/*.egg-info/
